{"id":1040,"date":"2026-08-20T09:29:26","date_gmt":"2026-08-20T09:29:26","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/?post_type=knowledgebase&#038;p=1040"},"modified":"2026-08-20T10:55:48","modified_gmt":"2026-08-20T10:55:48","slug":"the-drawing-engine","status":"publish","type":"knowledgebase","link":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/db\/shapes-drawing\/the-drawing-engine\/","title":{"rendered":"The Drawing Engine"},"content":{"rendered":"<div style=\"color: #2b2b2b;\">\n<h2 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">The Drawing Engine<\/span><\/h2>\n<p class=\"western\">Open Publisher includes a built-in freehand drawing engine for annotating documents, sketching layouts, or drawing directly over images. All finished drawings are automatically exported as transparent, print-safe PNGs and placed directly onto your document page.<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Accessing the Drawing Tools<\/span><\/h3>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-1047\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/AccessingTheDrawingTools.webp\" alt=\"Accessing the Drawing Tools\" width=\"97\" height=\"102\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/AccessingTheDrawingTools.webp 430w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/AccessingTheDrawingTools-287x300.webp 287w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 97px) 100vw, 97px\" \/><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">To open the drawing tools:<\/p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Go to the <strong>Insert<\/strong> ribbon tab.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Locate the <strong>Drawing<\/strong> group at the far right of the ribbon.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Select a tool from the group to begin drawing.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p class=\"western\">Four drawing tools are available:<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-1043\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-20-102843.png\" alt=\"available drawing tools \" width=\"361\" height=\"126\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-20-102843.png 1106w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-20-102843-300x105.png 300w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-20-102843-1024x357.png 1024w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-20-102843-768x268.png 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 361px) 100vw, 361px\" \/><\/h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Pencil &#8211;<\/strong> Classic, aliased pixel-perfect strokes for sharp, solid lines.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Brush &#8211;<\/strong> Anti-aliased paintbrush with rounded caps for smooth, organic strokes.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Spray Paint &#8211;<\/strong> Authentically scatters dots within a radius around your cursor for texture and shading effects. Radius and density scale with the brush size slider.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Eraser &#8211;<\/strong> Wipes away pixels from your drawing.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Brush Size &amp; Colour<br \/>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-1052\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/BrushSizeAndColor.webp\" alt=\"Brush Size &amp; Colour\" width=\"59\" height=\"59\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/BrushSizeAndColor.webp 468w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/BrushSizeAndColor-300x300.webp 300w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/BrushSizeAndColor-150x150.webp 150w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 59px) 100vw, 59px\" \/><\/span><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">A <strong>Brush Size<\/strong> slider spanning the Drawing group controls brush size dynamically from 1px to 50px. This also mathematically scales the Spray Paint dot radius and density.<\/p>\n<p class=\"western\">Use the <strong>Colour<\/strong> button in the Drawing group to set the active drawing colour before or during your drawing session.<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Undo<br \/>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-1054\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/undo.webp\" alt=\"Undo\" width=\"53\" height=\"58\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/undo.webp 415w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/undo-276x300.webp 276w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 53px) 100vw, 53px\" \/><\/span><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">Press <span style=\"font-family: Courier New, monospace;\">Ctrl+Z \/ Cmd+Z<\/span> while drawing, or click the <strong>Undo<\/strong> button in the ribbon, to instantly erase your last stroke.<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\"><br \/>\nFinishing a Drawing<br \/>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-1066\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/FinishiNGADrawing.webp\" alt=\"Finishing a Drawing\" width=\"58\" height=\"63\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/FinishiNGADrawing.webp 415w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/FinishiNGADrawing-276x300.webp 276w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 58px) 100vw, 58px\" \/><\/span><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">Click anywhere outside the drawing canvas to exit drawing mode.<\/p>\n<p class=\"western\">OpenPublisher will then automatically:<\/p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Scans the entire canvas and calculates the exact bounding box of your artwork.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Crops away all empty transparent space.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Exports a transparent, print-safe PNG and places it directly onto your document page.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Editing a Drawing<br \/>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-1076\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/EditingADrawing.webp\" alt=\"Editing a Drawing\" width=\"59\" height=\"55\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/EditingADrawing.webp 432w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/EditingADrawing-300x279.webp 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 59px) 100vw, 59px\" \/><\/span><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">Double-click any finished drawing on the canvas to restore it to the full-screen drawing canvas with all raw layer data intact, allowing seamless re-editing without any pixel degradation.<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Drawing Over Images<\/span><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-1078\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/DrawingOverImages.webp\" alt=\"Drawing Over Images\" width=\"59\" height=\"62\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/DrawingOverImages.webp 429w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/DrawingOverImages-285x300.webp 285w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 59px) 100vw, 59px\" \/>Select any image on the canvas and click <strong>Edit<\/strong> in the <strong>Picture Tools<\/strong> ribbon. The drawing engine overlays the canvas at the image&#8217;s exact coordinates, letting you annotate, spray-paint, or sketch directly on top of any photo or clipart in your document.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>The Drawing Engine Open Publisher includes a built-in freehand drawing engine for annotating documents, sketching layouts, or drawing directly over images. All finished drawings are automatically exported as transparent, print-safe PNGs and placed directly onto your document page. Accessing the Drawing Tools To open the drawing tools: Go to the Insert ribbon tab. Locate the [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":1081,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","template":"","knowledgebase_cat":[14],"class_list":["post-1040","knowledgebase","type-knowledgebase","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","knowledgebase_cat-shapes-drawing"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/1040","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase"}],"about":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/knowledgebase"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=1040"}],"version-history":[{"count":31,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/1040\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":1082,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/1040\/revisions\/1082"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/1081"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=1040"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"knowledgebase_cat","embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase_cat?post=1040"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}